  "instructions": [
    "Peel the lemons into a pot, add the Demerara sugar, and massage the sugar into the peels to make an oleo-saccharum.",
    "Let the lemon peels and sugar rest for about 30 minutes.",
    "Brew 4 cups of black tea and juice the peeled lemons.",
    "Add pineapple-infused rum and cognac to the oleo-saccharum, stir, and warm gently over low heat without boiling.",
    "Carefully ignite the warmed punch and let it burn for about 3 minutes, then cover the pot to extinguish the flame.",
    "Add the lemon juice and black tea, warm gently without boiling, then remove the lemon peels.",
    "Serve warm. Garnish with lemon oil, lemon wheels, or grated nutmeg."
  ],
